# demo_playingcard_detect Specification

## Overview

`demo_playingcard_detect` demonstrates playing card detection using OpenCV contour analysis.

## Usage

```bash
python demo_playingcard_detect.py [options]
```

## Arguments

| Argument | Type | Default | Description |
|----------|------|---------|-------------|
| `--device` | int | 0 | Camera device index |

## Features

- Card contour detection
- Aspect ratio filtering
- Card identification via template matching

## Exit

- Press ESC to quit
